& [CoreSolution] is a pure replicated semantic state machine
  + one SharedAttentionFrame carries exact participants faculty roles policy propositions constraints anchors evidence challenges focus capacity lifecycle lineage and two digests
  + one closed AttentionFrameDelta union proposes mutations against an exact generation frame digest policy and known author
  + batch reconciliation sorts by semantic identity rejects conflicting targets validates all operations and commits one successor or none
  + capacity is checked with overflow-safe canonical JSON UTF-8 byte accounting explicitly labelled as a token proxy
  + excess valid novelty yields typed immutable backpressure instead of silent focus or anchor eviction

& [CompactionSolution] is a separate Refiner-bound transition
  + exact-base compaction retains declared focus and monotonically reduces only removable working-set accounts
  + propositions constraints anchors evidence and context-budget identity remain unchanged
  + evidence and compaction identity enter successor lineage and reserved headroom is recomputed
  + buffered work must be rebound to the successor generation and digest before retry

& [SettlementSolution] is a two-phase exact-digest gate
  + prepare freezes an unchallenged working frame and recomputes its full identity
  + settle verifies every attestation digest participant role and candidate binding
  + every required participant plus Observer Honesty and Security acknowledgement is necessary for sealing
  + challenge defer or missing coverage returns a typed non-sealing result
  + sealing changes lifecycle and proof lineage but never upgrades proposition epistemic status

& [ImaginationSolution] is a bounded DreamFrame branch
  + a dream forks only from an exact sealed parent and declares invariants relaxed assumptions forbidden effects hypotheses evidence requirements consequences and falsifiers
  + hypotheses remain imagined and the branch cannot authorize or perform effects
  + evidence moves the branch into testing and exact Observer Honesty Security review may verify the declared branch contract
  + promotion emits only an assumed or inferred ordinary delta against the unchanged sealed parent
  + discard and every failed review preserve parent bytes

& [TransportSolution] is one effectless closed JSON process seam
  + cantor-shared-attention reads one bounded request from stdin or a named file and emits one machine response
  + eleven operations cover frame validation reconciliation compaction preparation settlement dream validation lifecycle and promotion projection
  + successful buffered semantic-refusal malformed-request and internal-fault classes have stable exit meanings
  + every response repeats the no-hidden-state no-external-effect and no-truth-by-settlement boundaries

& [DeploymentMapping] remains declarative
  + guard participants may carry Honesty and Security
  + projection participants may carry Planner and Weaver
  + server participants may carry Observer Scribe and Refiner
  + P0 defines their common state and gate contract but does not open a network or claim distributed consensus

& [Residuals] remain explicit
  + provider adapters MCP schema persistent event storage network transport cryptographic participant signatures token-aware budgets and deployment are successor work
  + semantic agreement is not external truth and DreamFrame verification is not universal factual verification
  + no llama.cpp hidden state KV cache provider process or autonomous effect is accessed

& [Disposition] is implemented_verified_effectless_P0
